<title>USA: Noland October sales rise 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Noland October sales rise 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noland Co said Monday its October sales were $43 million, 4.6 percent greater than October 1995's $41.1 million.  </p>
<p>Through the first 10 months of 1996, Noland said, the company's sales totaled $397.3 million, flat with those of the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>The firm distributes products in the plumbing, heating, electrical, air conditioning, refrigeration and industrial fields.</p>
